<title>SWITZERLAND: Landis&amp;Gyr shareholders approve Elektrowatt merger.</title>
<headline>Landis&amp;Gyr shareholders approve Elektrowatt merger.</headline>
<dateline>ZUG, Switzerland 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landis &amp; Gyr AG shareholders approved at an extraordinary meeting on Friday the company's merger with Elektrowatt AG. The vote was unanimous with the exception of one abstention, the company said.</p>
<p>Elektrowatt's acquisition of Landis &amp; Gyr for around 1.8 billion Swiss francs is retroactive to July 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Only a few Landis &amp; Gyr shares were not already held by Elektrowatt.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
